{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le10ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le10ob02re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn8le10ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn8le10ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The spicy rice can be made with Basmati or American rice.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Cook</span>: Could you tell me how to know the difference?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The Basmati is more fragrant. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Cook</span>: So you think that we can get by with either.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes. The other ingredients can be found in any good restaurant. The cinnamon sticks, turmeric, cardamom pods and cumin seeds ought to be kept in the spice pantry.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Cook</span>: Are they in what you call the dry cupboard?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes. The sultanas and cashews might be stored there as well.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn8le10ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Cook</span>: Do you mean they could be somewhere else?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Uh huh ... I guess we could  get rid of these dry onions. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Cook</span>: You want me to throw them away?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, leave them for stock. Was a new bag here when you got in?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Cook</span>: Yes. Honestly, we couldn't get along without a full bag of onions!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I think we have to get on with this. It's getting late.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Cook</span>: Of course!", "time": "27500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn8le10ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Fry the onions in sunflower oil. Boil some water. Add the spices. Next pour in the rice. It can be left to cook slowly for about 20 minutes.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Cook</span>: Can you tell me how to know it's ready?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It will be tender and a bit dry. Then toss in the other ingredients and stir in some white wine.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Cook</span>: If you ask me, there's no getting around this one being a real hit!", "time": "47000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about food and how to prepare it.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can explain my opinions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can ask for clarifications. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What restaurant or banquet hall events have you been to?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What type of food did they serve?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How successful was the event?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Let's go to a restaurant event!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "_da